      en: ["Gabú served as the capital of the Kaabu Empire until 1867.", "The city is a critical transit point for trade with neighboring Guinea.", "It hosts one of the most significant weekly cattle markets in the region.", "The majority of the local population belongs to the Fula ethnic group.", "Gabú is situated roughly 200 kilometers east of the capital, Bissau.", "The city is a major center for Islamic culture and scholarship in the country."],
