      en: ["Bissora is the economic heart of the Oio region in northern Guinea-Bissau.", "Cashew nut production is the primary source of income for local residents.", "The town is located about 90 kilometers north of the capital city, Bissau.", "It features a regional hospital that serves numerous surrounding villages.", "The Oio region produces a significant portion of the national cashew export.", "A strategic Portuguese military base was located here during the colonial war."],
