      en: ["Nhacra is the headquarters of the eponymous sector in the Oio Region.", "The town is located only about 30 km away from the capital, Bissau.", "The economy is primarily based on large-scale cashew nut cultivation.", "The region is an important transit area for trade with neighboring Senegal.", "The climate is tropical, featuring a distinct rainy season from June to October.", "Ethnically, the Balanta and Mandinka groups are dominant in Nhacra."],
