      en: ["Bulula acts as a major road junction on the highway leading to Buba.", "It hosts one of the largest weekly markets in the Quinará region.", "Palm wine is the most renowned local product from the area.", "The population mainly comprises the Balanta and Fula ethnic groups.", "Geographically, it is located near West Africa's deepest saltwater inlet.", "Traditional weaving techniques are still preserved in the nearby villages."],
